# Where the browser sends API calls. Copy to .env.local to override.
#
# Default (unset): "/api" — the Express gateway. In `npm run dev` Vite proxies
# /api to http://localhost:5000; in production you would put the gateway behind
# the same origin or set this to its public URL, e.g. https://my-gateway.example.com/api
#
# To talk straight to a deployed FastAPI service (e.g. a Hugging Face Space),
# set the service origin with no /api suffix:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://saminul-amin-airscript-backend.hf.space
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
